 ## Subtopics
 
 ### [Depth-plane Reduction](6446-depth-plane-reduction.md)
-A data rearrangement technique that shifts voxels to reduce depth planes before transformation, concentrating energy in the baseband.
+A data rearrangement technique that shifts voxels to fill empty depth planes before transformation, reducing the total number of depth planes and concentrating energy in the baseband.
 
 ### [3D Integer Wavelet Transform](6956-3d-integer-wavelet-transform.md)
-Maps integers to integers for perfect invertibility with finite precision.
+A lossless variant that maps integer input to integer coefficients using embedded rounding, ensuring perfect reconstruction with finite precision.
 
